---
// Architecture.astro
---

<section id="architecture" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-cyan-500/20">
        <i class="ri-cpu-line"></i>
        <span>底层架构与性能</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Rust 纯粹性能与精细化并发模型
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        摒弃沉重的外部运行时，采用 Rust 1.85+ 构建五层解耦 Crate 体系，在万级页面与大型 Monorepo 场景下依然保持毫秒级响应。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Crates Architecture Tree Diagram -->
    <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="ri-folder-shield-2-line text-emerald-400"></i>
          <span>工作区 Crate 分层拓扑</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Rust 2021 · 5 Crates</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="space-y-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
        
        <!-- Entry Layer -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-emerald-500/30">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-1">
              <span>crates/loredex-cli</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Binary</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-sans">
              clap 4.x 构建的极速 CLI，提供 CI 门禁、一键自愈与本地维护指令。
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-500/30">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-1">
              <span>crates/loredex-mcp</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-cyan-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Binary / Lib</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-sans">
              rmcp 3.x 标准 stdio server，读写并发门控，四层仓库智能解析链。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Engine Layer -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-teal-300 font-bold mb-1">
            <span>crates/loredex-engine</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] bg-teal-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Business Core</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-sans">
            核心业务调度：双重过期判定 (check_page)、行号漂移投影 (similar)、密钥检测拦截、runs.json 调度账本与 AGENTS.md 标记块管理。
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Git & Core Layers -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-300 font-bold mb-1">
              <span>crates/loredex-git</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-indigo-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Git Engine</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-sans">
              基于 git2 的只读高性能封装，对象库直读、按 commit 缓存 tree diff 与共享 GitView。
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-purple-300 font-bold mb-1">
              <span>crates/loredex-core</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-purple-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Zero-IO Model</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-sans">
              纯数据模型 (Status / Evidence / PageMeta)、中英文 CJK 二元分词与倒排索引。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Engineering Highlights Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 text-left">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-3">
          <i class="ri-speed-up-line text-lg"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">2,000 页硬核基准</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          采用 criterion 建立性能基准，CI 中通过 <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">--budget</code> 硬门禁限制回归下限，杜绝无节制变慢。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 text-left">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400 mb-3">
          <i class="ri-git-repository-commits-line text-lg"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">单次预计算 GitView</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          批量处理共享一个 GitView：HEAD 路径索引与改动树单次预计算，避免为每条引用重复扫大仓库。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 text-left">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 mb-3">
          <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-lg"></i>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1.5">80+ 测试 & MCP 进程内验证</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          集成测试直接构造双工 Client &harr; Server 走真实协议栈，测试覆盖率达 80-98%，稳固可靠。
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
